%% DPPL: interaksi teknis berdasarkan skenario SKPL
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Customer
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant Service as VehicleService
    participant Records as VehicleRepository
    participant Dep as AccessPolicy
    Customer->>UI: Create, update, or remove a vehicle
    UI->>Service: Submit customer vehicle management request
    Service->>Records: Validate vehicle details and account ownership
    Records-->>Service: Return current records and validation result
    Service->>Service: Validate kepemilikan dan nomor polisi unik bagi customer
    alt Valid
        Service->>Dep: requireOwner(customer, vehicle)
        Dep-->>Service: Result
        Service->>Records: Save the vehicle change
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the saved or calculated result
        Service-->>UI: Display the current vehicle list
        UI-->>Customer: Display the result and next step
    else Request needs correction or review
        Service-->>UI: Return vehicle validation errors
        UI-->>Customer: Display the reason and required action
    end
